   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## remove-bg.json\n\nCutout (BiRefNet)\n\n**Does:** subject mask / transparent cutout with BiRefNet.\n**Trap (cost real debugging time):** the MASK convention is **1 = transparent/selected**, and\n`RemoveBackground` returns 1 on the *foreground* \u2014 so you must insert **`InvertMask`** before\n`JoinImageWithAlpha`/`SaveImageWithAlpha`, or you get a perfectly inverted cutout.\n**Note:** `RemoveBackground` outputs a MASK, not an image.\n\n---\n*How to run it: story **S3** in `HOWTO.md`  \u00b7  Why it is this way: **E3b** in the scenarios' `EXPERIMENTS` logs.*"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## remove-bg.json\n\nCutout (BiRefNet)\n\n**Does:** subject mask / transparent cutout with BiRefNet.\n**Trap (cost real debugging time):** the MASK convention is **1 = transparent/selected**, and\n`RemoveBackground` returns 1 on the *foreground* \u2014 so you must insert **`InvertMask`** before\n`JoinImageWithAlpha`/`SaveImageWithAlpha`, or you get a perfectly inverted cutout.\n**Note:** `RemoveBackground` outputs a MASK, not an image.\n\n---\n*How to run it: story **S3** in `HOWTO.md`  \u00b7  Why it is this way: **E3b** in the scenarios' `EXPERIMENTS` logs.*"
   },
